---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base 
  title="Research Scope Map In Preparation"
  description="A draft map of astronomical research domains. Experiment status and gap assignments are under review."
  activeNav="taxonomy"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="tax-page-header">
    <span class="ansi-tag">[INDEX:RESEARCH SCOPE]</span>
    <span class="ansi-tag">DRAFT</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Research scope map in preparation</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">
      The outline below groups common astronomical research domains by scale and observational messenger. It is not a complete taxonomy, and it does not establish that Celestrium has active or validated experiments in each area. Experiment statuses and gap assignments are being reconciled with the research ledger.
    </p>
    <div class="incomplete-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="delineation-overview">
    <div class="section-kicker">// TWO-AXIS DELINEATION FRAMEWORK</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Physical Scale & Multi-Messenger Domains</h2>

    <div class="axes-grid">
      <div class="axis-card">
        <h3 class="axis-title">[AXIS 1] Physical Scale & Structure</h3>
        <ul class="axis-list">
          <li><strong>Solar & Astrodynamic (~10⁻⁶ – 10⁻⁴ pc):</strong> Solar magnetograms, flare forecasting, Near-Earth Object (NEO) short-arc orbit determination.</li>
          <li><strong>Stellar & Exoplanetary (~10⁻⁴ – 10 pc):</strong> Habitable transit detection, radial velocity red-noise GP disentanglement, asteroseismology.</li>
          <li><strong>Galactic & Interstellar (~1 – 10⁵ pc):</strong> Milky Way kinematics, Gaia astrometry, wide-binary MOND tests, brown dwarfs.</li>
          <li><strong>Extragalactic & AGN (~10⁵ – 10⁸ pc):</strong> Active Galactic Nuclei, quasar engines, galaxy clusters, host galaxy morphology.</li>
          <li><strong>Cosmological Horizon (~10⁸ – 10¹⁰ pc):</strong> Cosmological principle, quasar dipole, cosmic dawn, BAO, reionization.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="axis-card">
        <h3 class="axis-title">[AXIS 2] Observational Messengers</h3>
        <ul class="axis-list">
          <li><strong>Coherent & Line Radio:</strong> NVSS 1.4 GHz continuum, HI 21 cm emission, ALMA sub-mm molecular gas, CHIME/FRBs.</li>
          <li><strong>Optical & Infrared:</strong> Gaia DR3 astrometry, unWISE mid-IR, Rubin LSST time-domain alerts, Euclid DR1 Wide NIR.</li>
          <li><strong>High-Energy Photons:</strong> SDO solar EUV, Swift/Fermi GRBs, eROSITA X-ray clusters, CTA gamma-ray sources.</li>
          <li><strong>Gravitational Waves:</strong> LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA compact binary coalescences (BNS, BBH, NSBH), continuous GWs.</li>
          <li><strong>Astrophysical Neutrinos:</strong> IceCube Gold/Bronze track events, diffuse cosmic neutrino background.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="incomplete-rule"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="scope-note">
    <h2>Experiment status is under review</h2>
    <p>Use the <a href="/roadmap/">evidence and release roadmap</a> for current validation blockers and publication conditions. This draft map is excluded from search until its entries are verified.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .tax-page-header {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 1rem 0 1.2rem;
  }

  .page-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .delineation-overview {
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  .scope-note {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent-amber);
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  .scope-note h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .scope-note p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .section-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .axes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .axes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .axis-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 1.8rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .axis-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .axis-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .axis-list li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .axis-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
